  {
    "id": 1023004010010,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～……？\r\n何～……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300401/1023004010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今度のワンマンライブのことなんだけどさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00070",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 600,
    "se": "0478",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004010020,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "うん、何～？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "023",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102300401/1023004010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うわっ\r\n急に起き上がるからびっくりしたぞ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004010030,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "だって今度のワンマンライブの話でしょ\r\nそれで、何～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300401/1023004010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "前にも雛菜、衣装とかメイクとか\r\nステージのセットとか色々提案してくれただろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004010040,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あ～、うん\r\nそうだったね～",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300401/1023004010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004010050,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜、そういうの考えるの結構すきだから",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300401/1023004010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、だから今回も何か意見があれば、\r\nできるだけ反映させたいと思ってさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004010060,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "へ～！　いいの～？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300401/1023004010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん、予算や時間の都合で\r\nなんでもできるってわけじゃないし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "他のみんなからも案を募ろうとは思ってる",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、雛菜がそういうのに興味があるなら\r\n特に積極的に参加してもらいたいなと思ってさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004010070,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "うん～、いいよ～！\r\nやるやる～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300401/1023004010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうか\r\nそれならよかった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00466",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004010080,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "衣装とかメイクとかはやりたいの\r\nいっぱいあるし～……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300401/1023004010080"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0272",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004010090,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あと、他のアイドルの人がやってたライブの\r\nかわいいセットとか、結構スクショしてある！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300401/1023004010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……そうなのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004010100,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "うん！　デザインがかわいいな～って思った物とか\r\nいつもとりあえずスクショするから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300401/1023004010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004010110,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "色々ありすぎてどこにあるかわかんないけど～……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300401/1023004010110"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00070",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0280",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004010120,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "もっと色々見てかわいくて参考に\r\nなりそうなやつ探そ～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
